  "body": " Which of these are usable?   Fill in the table below. For each prescaler, what does the counter's clock frequency become, and how many counts does it take to get to 20 ms? Then decide which rows are usable, and why the others are not.       Prescaler  Timer clock  Counts for 20 ms (must fit)   1          2          6          60          240            "
